From: Shagg <shagg.dev88@gmail.com>
Subject: [PATCH] patch103 (GitHub #312): a PC with no audio output device runs silent (own sink) instead of crashing; the audio-driver hint is never left on a fallback; null-safe client calls; --audio_force_silent (test only); r37: the stream is published only once it plays

